                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Disclaimer: I was given a streamkey for the game.\n\nIt pains me to give a negative review for any game. But for this game i just can't justify the price of 7 dollars. It took me literally 15 minutes to beat the entire game and then there was nothing else to do other than a few achievements. \n\nThe game itself is pretty neat. However it reminds me of the flash games which can be found all over the net. I am a HUGE fan of these small games and i have several in my library (like Epic Battle Fantasy, Knightmare tower and Bloons 5) however they all have something to keep you playing. If this game added a bit of customization or goals to go towards then that would be a huge step in the right direction. but as it stands now its play once and then never again.",
